# A on Arima's event objects (ObjID $38): the six blown doors are
# index 1 -- loc_DA74 (ps2.asm:20022), "Those scoundrels seem to have
# blown open the door with dynamite and stolen the things." ($170A) --
# and the control tower at 19,17 is index 2, $1709 as in Oputa. Before
# build 69 both gave $1708 and "event $0N is not ported" on stderr.

start level 5 9 9            # Arima, below the blown door at 9,7
wait screen level
wait idle
walk up 1                    # 9,8, facing it
wait step
expect level 5 9 8
press a
wait idle
expect script $170A
shot 01_blown_door
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect level 5 9 8
walk down 8
wait idle
walk right 10                # 19,16, above the tower's event
wait idle
expect level 5 19 16
press down                   # face it: the block's box is solid
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1709
shot 02_tower
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect no-stderr not ported
